(6740099, 1009322, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the noise grain here which adds a bit of texture to the photo. I think it is a little dark which is probably why you have the noise in the first place. The cinematic effect of your composition is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the noise grain here which adds a bit of texture to the photo. I think it is a little dark which is probably why you have the noise in the first place. The cinematic effect of your composition is a nice touch.', '2012-04-13 00:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740101, 1008316, 143659, '<td valign="top">wow this would be a terrible day</td>', 'wow this would be a terrible day', '2012-04-13 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740105, 1009286, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did a good job with a tough exposure here. No real bad clipping in the highlights that I can detect with the eye which is really outstanding work in this light. Did you use the sunny 16 rule?? I would suggest trying a different viewpoint to avoid the clutter in the photo. Zoom in and aim more toward the cheerleaders to avoid the left side of the lane and a lot of the sky and city background. But now that I look at the photo I can see you are showing the runner''s view... so just ignore my last critique.</td>', 'You did a good job with a tough exposure here. No real bad clipping in the highlights that I can detect with the eye which is really outstanding work in this light. Did you use the sunny 16 rule?? I would suggest trying a different viewpoint to avoid the clutter in the photo. Zoom in and aim more toward the cheerleaders to avoid the left side of the lane and a lot of the sky and city background. But now that I look at the photo I can see you are showing the runner''s view... so just ignore my last critique.', '2012-04-13 00:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740107, 1009271, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you clipped the shadows a little too much. The big black shadow on the pipe wall mixes too much with the silhouetted person creating a big blob. You lost the definition in your silhouetted shape.</td>', 'I think you clipped the shadows a little too much. The big black shadow on the pipe wall mixes too much with the silhouetted person creating a big blob. You lost the definition in your silhouetted shape.', '2012-04-13 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740114, 1009094, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have been so much nicer if you could have eliminated the sky somehow... Crop out the sky and the left side of the shot so the path leads from the bottom corner to the top left corner of the frame. I think that would make a nicer shot here. I do really like the emotive feeling of the person on the path leading to the end of the road. But the high contrast tones are definitely not giving off that peaceful tranuility you are trying to communicate.</td>', 'I think this shot would have been so much nicer if you could have eliminated the sky somehow... Crop out the sky and the left side of the shot so the path leads from the bottom corner to the top left corner of the frame. I think that would make a nicer shot here. I do really like the emotive feeling of the person on the path leading to the end of the road. But the high contrast tones are definitely not giving off that peaceful tranuility you are trying to communicate.', '2012-04-13 00:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740117, 1009249, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice little story telling image. I think you need to make a choice between the vignette or the border... but don''t use both.</td>', 'Nice little story telling image. I think you need to make a choice between the vignette or the border... but don''t use both.', '2012-04-13 00:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6740119, 1009310, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like your view point here, keeping the frame away from the street and the cars and more on the buildings which gives a sense of location for the story that goies along with the shot.</td>', 'I like your view point here, keeping the frame away from the street and the cars and more on the buildings which gives a sense of location for the story that goies along with the shot.', '2012-04-13 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
