(6741661, 1009249, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice story to go with this one.  I like that the person is just visible up the road - you wonder if it is the one who left the flowers or the one who missed out on them.   Either way, this works very well!</td>', 'A nice story to go with this one.  I like that the person is just visible up the road - you wonder if it is the one who left the flowers or the one who missed out on them.   Either way, this works very well!', '2012-04-14 20:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741662, 1008737, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very lush - somewhere that gets lots of rain, I''d say!  I''d rather not have the horizon be dead center when the sky is not particularly strong.  But it does set a rather damp and sorta dreary mood.</td>', 'Very lush - somewhere that gets lots of rain, I''d say!  I''d rather not have the horizon be dead center when the sky is not particularly strong.  But it does set a rather damp and sorta dreary mood.', '2012-04-14 20:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741663, 1009301, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is simply delightful.  One wonders what all he keeps in those coolers!  He seems to be so very well organized.  And I''m betting that he''s probably pretty happy, too.  While some may see this "end of the road" as a downside, I suspect he does not.  Very fitting entry for the challenge!</td>', 'This is simply delightful.  One wonders what all he keeps in those coolers!  He seems to be so very well organized.  And I''m betting that he''s probably pretty happy, too.  While some may see this "end of the road" as a downside, I suspect he does not.  Very fitting entry for the challenge!', '2012-04-14 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741665, 1009120, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting option for the challenge.  The photo itself is a bit less than impressive technically - seems just a bit muddy, as though it were taken with a cell phone, perhaps.  But the sentiment works well here.</td>', 'An interesting option for the challenge.  The photo itself is a bit less than impressive technically - seems just a bit muddy, as though it were taken with a cell phone, perhaps.  But the sentiment works well here.', '2012-04-14 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
