(6741667, 1009248, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed!  And scary dragons at that!  He seems quite full of himself.</td>', 'Indeed!  And scary dragons at that!  He seems quite full of himself.', '2012-04-14 20:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741668, 1008729, 30982, '<td valign="top">San Clemente, if I''m not mistaken.  Nice take with the double yellow!  I don''t like the ocean leaking right - a quick fix of the horizon would be good.  I do like the seagull just catching the light.  By the way, the restaurant right there on the left?  Great clams by the bucketfull.</td>', 'San Clemente, if I''m not mistaken.  Nice take with the double yellow!  I don''t like the ocean leaking right - a quick fix of the horizon would be good.  I do like the seagull just catching the light.  By the way, the restaurant right there on the left?  Great clams by the bucketfull.', '2012-04-14 20:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741670, 1008688, 30982, '<td valign="top">The white cliffs of somewhere, yes?  Is that a person in the water?  Either way, the fallen dock gives us a sense of the scale here.</td>', 'The white cliffs of somewhere, yes?  Is that a person in the water?  Either way, the fallen dock gives us a sense of the scale here.', '2012-04-14 20:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
