(6741679, 1008425, 30982, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous road, and what lovely rendition of the light and shadow.  I thank you for including a traveler in the photo - it adds immensely to the feel of the journey.</td>', 'A gorgeous road, and what lovely rendition of the light and shadow.  I thank you for including a traveler in the photo - it adds immensely to the feel of the journey.', '2012-04-14 20:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
