(6741790, 1009106, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love long political commentary as titles.  :-)  OK, not really.  But I do like the picture.  There''s some odd stuff going on in the sky, like burn or dodge or erase marks, but bear in mind my monitor is WAY too bright so I see stuff a lot of folks will never notice.  I like the desolation of this, espeically how the shiny "With TECHRON" sign is overwhelmed by the closed-ness of the joint.</td>', 'Love long political commentary as titles.  :-)  OK, not really.  But I do like the picture.  There''s some odd stuff going on in the sky, like burn or dodge or erase marks, but bear in mind my monitor is WAY too bright so I see stuff a lot of folks will never notice.  I like the desolation of this, espeically how the shiny "With TECHRON" sign is overwhelmed by the closed-ness of the joint.', '2012-04-14 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
