(6741916, 1009097, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit lengthy on the title but I like the smiles!  I also like that you can just see the ring on her finger (or at least I think I can.)</td>', 'A bit lengthy on the title but I like the smiles!  I also like that you can just see the ring on her finger (or at least I think I can.)', '2012-04-15 02:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
