(6741918, 1008316, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  That''ll teach ''em!  Did they ever get out of there??  This is one of those shots where technical "perfection" isn''t key - just catching the moment is wonderful!</td>', 'Ha!  That''ll teach ''em!  Did they ever get out of there??  This is one of those shots where technical "perfection" isn''t key - just catching the moment is wonderful!', '2012-04-15 02:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741920, 1009285, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, I feel for those guys.  That looks so cold!  I hope that little one isn''t thinking of making a break for it.</td>', 'Dang, I feel for those guys.  That looks so cold!  I hope that little one isn''t thinking of making a break for it.', '2012-04-15 02:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741921, 1009173, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like this!  I will say that the sky color looks just a bit off - as though it were probably washed out and "forced" into color.  In situations like that I tend to just prefer to leave it washed out.  Life gets washed out at times!  :-)</td>', 'Nice.  I like this!  I will say that the sky color looks just a bit off - as though it were probably washed out and "forced" into color.  In situations like that I tend to just prefer to leave it washed out.  Life gets washed out at times!  :-)', '2012-04-15 02:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6741924, 1009141, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the sentiment, but the photo itself is a bit on the "eh" side.  Not sure of a better way to photograph a waste bin, though.</td>', 'I like the sentiment, but the photo itself is a bit on the "eh" side.  Not sure of a better way to photograph a waste bin, though.', '2012-04-15 02:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
