(6743606, 1009246, 142473, '<td valign="top">Magnificent image.  I think I may have trued burning in some of the mountain layers though, just to give it some extra oomph.</td>', 'Magnificent image.  I think I may have trued burning in some of the mountain layers though, just to give it some extra oomph.', '2012-04-16 16:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
