(6743609, 1009244, 142473, '<td valign="top">I really like the image, but don''t understand the metaphor.<br/> <br/>I think getting a tad more green in down low could have been good, to give this image 3 different layer... green, yellow, and purple.<br/> <br/>I''d also clone out the white vertical sticks on the right.</td>', 'I really like the image, but don''t understand the metaphor. I think getting a tad more green in down low could have been good, to give this image 3 different layer... green, yellow, and purple. I''d also clone out the white vertical sticks on the right.', '2012-04-16 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743611, 1009322, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, a bit strange though.  Lots of noise, and the tire doesn''t seem to make a ton of sense.  Or maybe it does given the challenge?</td>', 'Interesting image, a bit strange though.  Lots of noise, and the tire doesn''t seem to make a ton of sense.  Or maybe it does given the challenge?', '2012-04-16 16:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743613, 1009222, 142473, '<td valign="top">Given a little more quality, this image could have really hit it on the nail for me.  Maybe it''s just a matter of sharpening - or the lack thereof, but something is lacking a bit technically.  Conceptually I really like it though.</td>', 'Given a little more quality, this image could have really hit it on the nail for me.  Maybe it''s just a matter of sharpening - or the lack thereof, but something is lacking a bit technically.  Conceptually I really like it though.', '2012-04-16 16:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743615, 1008836, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great simplicity.  The pink shorts become the true focal point, and I think they are just pink enough to make their impact.</td>', 'Great simplicity.  The pink shorts become the true focal point, and I think they are just pink enough to make their impact.', '2012-04-16 16:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743616, 1009271, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract image.  The colors emanating from the end of the tunnel are great.</td>', 'Interesting abstract image.  The colors emanating from the end of the tunnel are great.', '2012-04-16 16:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743618, 1008600, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, nice muted colors, really sweet cloud cover.  I''m not sure, but a little motion blur at the tip could be nice, but I''m not sure if it''s needed.</td>', 'Great clarity, nice muted colors, really sweet cloud cover.  I''m not sure, but a little motion blur at the tip could be nice, but I''m not sure if it''s needed.', '2012-04-16 16:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
