(6743621, 1009067, 142473, '<td valign="top">Cropping off some of the sidewalk could have put the subject at a bit more of a 1/3, which could be a bit more aesthetically pleasing.  But a nice subject otherwise.</td>', 'Cropping off some of the sidewalk could have put the subject at a bit more of a 1/3, which could be a bit more aesthetically pleasing.  But a nice subject otherwise.', '2012-04-16 16:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
