(6744604, 1009341, 142473, '<td valign="top">Could be a good shot, but a bit dark in my opinion.  A bit over sharpened too.  The lighting is very harsh.  A little fill in the right side of her face could have gone a long way.  I think the same shot with a little more sunlight could have gone over well.<br/> <br/>The hair (I think it is) on the side of her pants annoys me too... it cannot be unseen.</td>', 'Could be a good shot, but a bit dark in my opinion.  A bit over sharpened too.  The lighting is very harsh.  A little fill in the right side of her face could have gone a long way.  I think the same shot with a little more sunlight could have gone over well. The hair (I think it is) on the side of her pants annoys me too... it cannot be unseen.', '2012-04-17 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
