(6744608, 1009117, 142473, '<td valign="top">He just needs some dark aviators to finish off the look.  Otherwise a solid capture, good lighting.  Funny take on the challenge.</td>', 'He just needs some dark aviators to finish off the look.  Otherwise a solid capture, good lighting.  Funny take on the challenge.', '2012-04-17 17:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6744610, 1008821, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting to be sure, and a good point of view.  Editing is ok, but not exactly my cup o tea.  The glow could be a bit larger or fainter and maybe not hurt anything.  Or maybe it works over the city, but extending over the tree on the right throws it off.</td>', 'Interesting to be sure, and a good point of view.  Editing is ok, but not exactly my cup o tea.  The glow could be a bit larger or fainter and maybe not hurt anything.  Or maybe it works over the city, but extending over the tree on the right throws it off.', '2012-04-17 17:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6744611, 1009285, 142473, '<td valign="top">Cooooold looking.  Too bad they limit you to 800 pixels, I would have liked to see this 1000 or 1200 wide to really make the impact.  Funny the longer I look at it, the more little sheep heads I see everywhere.</td>', 'Cooooold looking.  Too bad they limit you to 800 pixels, I would have liked to see this 1000 or 1200 wide to really make the impact.  Funny the longer I look at it, the more little sheep heads I see everywhere.', '2012-04-17 17:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
